      "questionId": "qe-c08-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-s005",
      "sentenceText": "This task involved questions like: Who was the only U.S. president to also hold a patent for an invention?",
      "sentenceSha256": "e43c784e15b05695885fb2badfcf362f52a8ac75e5dfdcbe4ea50bb24c00d2fc",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-038",
      "parentFingerprint": "810d7f39e0ae839756991206d8946d32ca0acb595e6856c551054ae87a3af026",
      "passageSha256": "22f460d711c5bbcb72527c77938cfd81c34159507a827ce10eb3240077e4924f",
      "pdfPages": [
        84,
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-s006",
      "sentenceText": "In this task, after a question was presented, there were two response options: a wait button and a skip button.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3a2b303450d3a383286d185a94944e43cf3a0dcb573b18471f1f6e7159dc7304",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-038",
      "parentFingerprint": "810d7f39e0ae839756991206d8946d32ca0acb595e6856c551054ae87a3af026",
      "passageSha256": "22f460d711c5bbcb72527c77938cfd81c34159507a827ce10eb3240077e4924f",
      "pdfPages": [
        84,
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-s008",
      "sentenceText": "If they hit the wait button, they had to wait for a certain amount of time (the precise time was randomized between ten and fifteen seconds) to get an answer (e.g., Abraham Lincoln).",
      "sentenceSha256": "f58f0fc276111a1f01b014f479cb83b6df286714bb6a5ce55486c444bd23f00f",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-r008-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "df51b1597e7f941c868dc64e08ab80f3870d5ee269092506705409d38affc77e",
      "passageSha256": "605a3e2945c17516a1a8625708f9cf48e952f3777cdaa9eb380d1a17019cd34f",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Typically, curious people wanted to know the answer, so they were willing to wait.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9cafde66f43411077ca4f55219e42753e725acb4ebaf2fcf8cad9bcc4a91f1ed",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-r008-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "df51b1597e7f941c868dc64e08ab80f3870d5ee269092506705409d38affc77e",
      "passageSha256": "605a3e2945c17516a1a8625708f9cf48e952f3777cdaa9eb380d1a17019cd34f",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-s010",
      "sentenceText": "Our experiment consisted of fifteen questions.",
      "sentenceSha256": "09ac9377ab6c108615b56936f0f8473ad6cda9523df6372e72ba52a26e8ae9f7",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-r008-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "df51b1597e7f941c868dc64e08ab80f3870d5ee269092506705409d38affc77e",
      "passageSha256": "605a3e2945c17516a1a8625708f9cf48e952f3777cdaa9eb380d1a17019cd34f",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0057",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p085-02700-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In other words, when you are assigned to be a specialist, you lose interest in other seemingly irrelevant matters.",
      "sentenceSha256": "250b0cb71f04b11977496e96cce379d371fd64ec219388974678805f2db7c88d",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p085-02700-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "8208fc9c91fae097a76b5bb37fc3dab5bedf2b431e68e78a61b14b9fef5e924e",
      "passageSha256": "198942e8a5e5a79b2724126d88458b0664638e872b688569facc63e49789c73a",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0058",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p085-02700-s003",
      "sentenceText": "When you are assigned to be a generalist, you are more curious about other things.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2d0daee09de07499f08bb2e258609a3107bdaf9d46aa2ab4b35c3b4a967a6bee",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p085-02700-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "8208fc9c91fae097a76b5bb37fc3dab5bedf2b431e68e78a61b14b9fef5e924e",
      "passageSha256": "198942e8a5e5a79b2724126d88458b0664638e872b688569facc63e49789c73a",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0059",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-s001",
      "sentenceText": "But why?",
      "sentenceSha256": "dd724a9022a9afcbdcc5fcc51508a357ce033b6a88543b7ee69880609582906d",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "87d7b3c27ff8541aa285fcf5030399e699e0ca4a2ff9994d8cde2c2c38363bb7",
      "passageSha256": "2ee777138f83fff1f5ebef453c32350bc381d12bb56491af845a2a02909e5a75",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0060",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Well, when you specialize in something, you are selectively attending to what is relevant to your specialty and trying to ignore irrelevant information.",
      "sentenceSha256": "39476a5a2803498148d2d59f214024cd96a0f6271ec9c9a9f0465da9858dffa4",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "87d7b3c27ff8541aa285fcf5030399e699e0ca4a2ff9994d8cde2c2c38363bb7",
      "passageSha256": "2ee777138f83fff1f5ebef453c32350bc381d12bb56491af845a2a02909e5a75",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0061",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Specialization gives you deep knowledge in certain topics and marketable skills.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d0eca668a5e85c23b7554f96bacadcc09ee763555a91ad5edc82feb30f9000a3",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "87d7b3c27ff8541aa285fcf5030399e699e0ca4a2ff9994d8cde2c2c38363bb7",
      "passageSha256": "2ee777138f83fff1f5ebef453c32350bc381d12bb56491af845a2a02909e5a75",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0062",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-s005",
      "sentenceText": "But unintentionally, specialization leaves you uninterested in other areas of life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "88c7277cbfbd253a0ecd5bacae6798f6b8fe8aab20ff679699e78a656f6ee075",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p085-03870-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "484e30fc2a6ecbf3e492bb2385c8372d13e647ea1f303800e983b777b0e271b8",
      "passageSha256": "0e20f284db581705de01bac23e9d797f44f66fc50b8b17f0ce1ea4de1daca5ce",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0063",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Outsourcing is a modern way to live more efficiently.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d2d873280f56f7a470c48f81760fb06eaf8c0cb38389b92c52eadab73da64248",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "934a15078d3c1703b7dae6f9949975c8ec9158286757fe70aaf5233f9a2192e4",
      "passageSha256": "f287aa6c5735e709dec9e1f108f01f2bc0e73104eafe9845bae78b1f6edd5c0c",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0064",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Professionals do jobs such as mowing the lawn and cleaning the gutters much better and more quickly than individuals can.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7c3c5623829f8c3494ea996d1eb52d7f49800d9464187cd65a7ac1030702adf7",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "934a15078d3c1703b7dae6f9949975c8ec9158286757fe70aaf5233f9a2192e4",
      "passageSha256": "f287aa6c5735e709dec9e1f108f01f2bc0e73104eafe9845bae78b1f6edd5c0c",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0065",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-s004",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, you pay $200 for a person to clean your house.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c26038c47a1f1c075480c10dbd34013ee5f8dafd00610221b28dbba396cf2999",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "934a15078d3c1703b7dae6f9949975c8ec9158286757fe70aaf5233f9a2192e4",
      "passageSha256": "f287aa6c5735e709dec9e1f108f01f2bc0e73104eafe9845bae78b1f6edd5c0c",
      "pdfPages": [
        85
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0066",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-s005",
      "sentenceText": "You save a few hours of free time, which presumably translates into more happiness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0658d85d0cfa15dca8bc5281d0585fd503734de410b3ed7a80fc24a8c50af0b4",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "c083c2cd16eefcb5423790072fd787c1a30bb16b536e4b6f088821bca03e5deb",
      "passageSha256": "ac5905d4fc2e70512afa0fa066838671ab8a5cf5212c3289e53ce5db9216f3ec",
      "pdfPages": [
        85,
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0067",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-s008",
      "sentenceText": "That is, those who spent money on time-saving services were less stressed about time, and the less stressed about time someone is, the more satisfied they are with their lives overall.",
      "sentenceSha256": "65039d8e89f937fd1a69529848ffe04cd76423e6e068d7020dcf1e213de2dba7",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p085-06135-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "c083c2cd16eefcb5423790072fd787c1a30bb16b536e4b6f088821bca03e5deb",
      "passageSha256": "ac5905d4fc2e70512afa0fa066838671ab8a5cf5212c3289e53ce5db9216f3ec",
      "pdfPages": [
        85,
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0068",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-02115-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Whillans and colleagues then conducted an experiment to test the causal role of time-saving spending.",
      "sentenceSha256": "88af8f4eb3e4945ab61908e513731ea0be47b7b2189855b8450c8debfe041e87",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "951a48f65bc09e87acae09794dba75eee8974e80850e63266f1a7a8b9dc1bc05",
      "passageSha256": "036a3e3611c8474178354b22945528041198082b10a691e53bdf06014c347ce4",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0069",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-02115-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Participants were contacted on the days they spent $40.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a8d9584e9e942873aaa050b286e863f2aba949674f72dc7f03f20ae8907d7840",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "951a48f65bc09e87acae09794dba75eee8974e80850e63266f1a7a8b9dc1bc05",
      "passageSha256": "036a3e3611c8474178354b22945528041198082b10a691e53bdf06014c347ce4",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0070",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-02115-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Participants reported more positive emotions and less negative emotions after the time-saving spending than after the material purchase.",
      "sentenceSha256": "159b235a217dd69259766d273da53e7b832a21ae0648e4a890c3061cb79de17a",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "951a48f65bc09e87acae09794dba75eee8974e80850e63266f1a7a8b9dc1bc05",
      "passageSha256": "036a3e3611c8474178354b22945528041198082b10a691e53bdf06014c347ce4",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0071",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-03675-s002",
      "sentenceText": "It is all about freeing up time.",
      "sentenceSha256": "14dd0c49c64b7840f262961acb8619be9a12e44cc8db34fb182ea15ec2ec1c99",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "ee4f4b133f343db125e72ecdbb88c7b281d7ccdd1f75d9271820cdec52ec47d4",
      "passageSha256": "7c1f690f4c780230d48f59a4f6e3cf8914ceb83ba75c79b6f6a1e679fb95378e",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0072",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-03675-s003",
      "sentenceText": "To the extent that you are paying someone to do the tasks you don’t want to do and as a result gaining free time, it should increase your happiness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6a7b154d5017a99e1a307497a5eb27d999bcba4e7fe13753bc26cec266b266d5",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "ee4f4b133f343db125e72ecdbb88c7b281d7ccdd1f75d9271820cdec52ec47d4",
      "passageSha256": "7c1f690f4c780230d48f59a4f6e3cf8914ceb83ba75c79b6f6a1e679fb95378e",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0073",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-03675-s004",
      "sentenceText": "But does outsourcing detract from psychological richness, just as specialization and division of labor do?",
      "sentenceSha256": "3c47620fc4c9e3bce27b961102393b88973eab5556a33432fa75b338e28d893a",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "ee4f4b133f343db125e72ecdbb88c7b281d7ccdd1f75d9271820cdec52ec47d4",
      "passageSha256": "7c1f690f4c780230d48f59a4f6e3cf8914ceb83ba75c79b6f6a1e679fb95378e",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0074",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s001",
      "sentenceText": "A while ago, my wife and I were thinking about converting our unkempt side yard to a brick patio.",
      "sentenceSha256": "65fa8abc90b06aaf7857833ef50ae52674e352ac601692b97e85eb409ace17b8",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "1360b8366ef2a0b9b440733f68e9ba72063701a16a6b903f1957f2d48523779d",
      "passageSha256": "770c41a5e9fc8e89bee23469b114ab2d48063e7a85e76cd63d4e4ddb35e906be",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0075",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s004",
      "sentenceText": "We thought to ourselves, couldn’t we do all the digging and labor ourselves if it meant saving at least $5,000?",
      "sentenceSha256": "3695026f91555b5c33ddb78412f09ece12a0ceb59b6bf08bb0a5e8f91f7f8108",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "1360b8366ef2a0b9b440733f68e9ba72063701a16a6b903f1957f2d48523779d",
      "passageSha256": "770c41a5e9fc8e89bee23469b114ab2d48063e7a85e76cd63d4e4ddb35e906be",
      "pdfPages": [
        86
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0076",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Being cheap, we decided to do it ourselves.",
      "sentenceSha256": "df71d5e391f94f0923853c659459361986c4a770842873a46e7f80eddf9aafd3",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-050",
      "parentFingerprint": "e545781a4d17deb98a114f24adbc98a5ffa9c9ad24c5b3137f24d14cc2dfa1db",
      "passageSha256": "7ef26a54aec3c67d5e744a8d21ef8a6dbae9f387a3a671f0123cf942e237acdf",
      "pdfPages": [
